00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:16.660
Yes, sir.

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:18.260
You got a statement?

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:19.540
Yes, sir. We do.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:26.260
Despite my reluctance to live and practice in a small rural community,

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:29.970
I have served the borough of Arrowhead in good...

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:36.340
faith. However, that good faith has not been reciprocated, and therefore, I have been left

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:43.900
with no other recourse but to withhold my services so that I may obtain what is contractually

00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:54.370
and morally mine. And, uh, oh yes, uh, taking questions from the floor now. How long do

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:59.830
you intend to keep this nonsense up? Ruthann, I feel that that question should be directed

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:03.980
to the state of Alaska, as they're the ones who have reneged on our agreement,

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:07.000
and they're the ones who have the power to break this impasse.

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:09.100
Shelly.

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:10.940
What if somebody gets really sick?

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:15.300
You know, like they're seriously hurling, or they cut off a finger with a bandsaw?

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:21.440
Yes, well, although, once again, I feel that that question should be directed to the state of Alaska,

00:18:22.150 --> 00:18:24.920
I have made arrangements with Dr. Kornhauser.

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:28.740
We know he lives over in Moose Pass, to take care of any such emergency.

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:29.940
All right, let's cut through.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.710
